== Quest Start ==
Talk to Enchanter Jolas in the [[Plane of Sky]].

You say, 'Hail, Enchanter Jolas'
:''Enchanter Jolas says, 'Greetings, Gand.  Have you come here to test your [powers of enchantment]?' ''
You say, 'powers of enchantment'
:''Enchanter Jolas says, 'I am most honored to be able to help you.  Of the many aspects of enchantment, I can offer you the following tests.  [Illusion], [dislocation], [metamorphism], [deception], [memorization], and finally [incapacitation].' ''

== Enchanter Test of Illusion ==

You say, 'Illusion'
:''Enchanter Jolas says, 'Illusion it is.  Proceed upward through the sky and return to me a finely woven cloth cord and a wind rune meda.  This will prove your abilities to me and I will reward you with a cord of sphinx hair.' ''

'''Reward:''' {{:Sphinx Hair Cord}}

